# What Vercel uploads. Static files left here (icons, manifests, sw.js) are
# served by the platform as-is; everything else goes through api/index.py.
# The built pages are NOT deployed as static files — they carry renter names
# and must stay behind the login, so they arrive via publish.py instead.
